0..73 Comment "// The reads of an inert field that are refused, and the marks that stand"
74..85 Comment "// nowhere."
86..88 Comment "//"
89..166 Comment "// Only the manifest step and another inert field read an inert field. A mark"
167..226 Comment "// on anything but an operation has no field to make inert."
227..229 Comment "//"
230..302 Comment "// A read by a path, by a name inside the model or off a model binder is"
303..383 Comment "// refused `InertRead` at the read. A misplaced mark is refused malformed at its"
384..392 Comment "// name."
393..395 Comment "//"
396..450 Comment "// - see: #3029 — the mark and the refusal of a read"
451..517 Comment "// - see: `model/modules/inert-field.gandr` — the reads admitted"
